  <metadata>
    <name>TrackMe demo ride</name>
    <desc>Recorded on the iOS Simulator against Apple's "City Bicycle Ride" location scenario, Cupertino CA, Cycling persona. Signal gaps wider than 2s were filled with 1Hz interpolated fixes (283 of 1581 points); the rider was stationary across every gap, the largest positional jump being 6.5m. Elevation is 0.0 throughout because the scenario supplies no terrain data. Shipped identically on Android and iOS as the first-run sample ride and the onboarding History demo.</desc>
    <time>2026-08-21T16:01:36Z</time>
  </metadata>
